    <decisions>
        <description>Fixed-price products will always generate the same ARR, so it doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s a renewal, the ARR remains unchanged.</description>
        <name>Is_Fixed_ARR</name>
        <label>Is Fixed ARR</label>
        <locationX>446</locationX>
        <locationY>323</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Cancellation</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Quote_Line_Type__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Cancellation</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Original_Opportunity_Product_Cancellation</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Cancellation</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Amendment</name>
            <conditionLogic>or</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Quote_Line_Type__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Amendment</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Amendment_No_ARR</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Amendment</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Calculate_ARR</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND 2 AND 3</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Opportunity.IsClosed</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Product2.IsActive</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Quote_Line_Type__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>New</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Current_FX_rate</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Calculate ARR</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Products:
P2P Monthly Security fee - FWP2PE1100
Epic Secure Checkout (SaaS) - FWSC1000
Healthcare Platform - FWHC1000
WPM Gateway - Platform Plus Fees - FWPM1100
Secure Checkout - FWSC2000
Third Party Invoicing - FWSI1000
1098-T (SaaS) - FW1098T
eStore - FWES1000
Agency Management - FWAM1000
SFS Package - Custom (UK) - FWSFS1401
SFS Package - Deluxe (UK) - FWSFS1501
SFS Package - Standard (UK) - FWSFS1301
StudyLink License Fee - Admit Enterprise -FWSL1000
StudyLink License Fee - Admit Standard -FWSL1010
StudyLink License Fee - Capture -FWSL1020
SFS Package - Custom -FWSFS1400
SFS Package - Deluxe -FWSFS1500
SFS Package - Quick Start Collection Management -FWSFS1100
SFS Package - Standard -FWSFS1300
Static Statements - FWSFS1900
Virtual Terminal (SaaS) - FWVT1000
eRefunds - FWEREF1000
Historical 1098-T Static Import - FWSFS2100
Trolley Payables - SaaS Fee - FWAG1310

Calculate ARR for fixed price products using UnitPrice and quotelines prorate multiplier. Updated to include all products where Rate_Type__c = &apos;Fixed&apos; and Include_in_ARR__c = &apos;Yes&apos; 07/25/2024. Use Quote_Line_Type__c instead of Opportunity.Type 07/26/2024. BOPI-511 Updated to calculate ARR when Quote Line Type not &apos;Cancellation&apos;. BOPI-603 updated to set ARR to 0 for cancelled lines. BOPI-620 updated to set the ARR for cancelled lines to the original amount as a negative value

5/4/2026 SALDEV-1203 Add in new decision criteria to only calculate ARR if Quote Line Type = New.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Calculated_Annual_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>({!$Record.UnitPrice} / {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c}) / {!ConversionRate}</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Calculated_Monthly_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>(({!$Record.UnitPrice} / {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c}) * 12)/ {!ConversionRate}</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Cancelled_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Original_Opportunity_Product_Cancellation.Opp_Product_ARR__c} * (-1)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>RenewalRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Renewal Calculated: &quot; + TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>RevenueCalculatedMonthly</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Product2.Name} + &quot; - ((&quot; + TEXT({!$Record.UnitPrice}/{!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c}) + &quot; * 12) /&quot; + TEXT({!ConversionRate}) + 
&quot; Calculated: &quot;+ 
TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>RevenueCalculatedTextAnnual</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Product2.Name} + &quot; - &quot; + TEXT({!$Record.UnitPrice} / {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.SBQQ__ProrateMultiplier__c}) + &quot;/&quot; + TEXT({!ConversionRate}) + 
&quot; Calculated: &quot;+ 
TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>(Opp Product) Fixed Price Products ARR calculation {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>(Opp Product) Fixed Price Products ARR calculation</label>
